# Input
```html
<!-- should not generate diagnostics -->

<button>Submit</button>

<button aria-label="Close"></button>

<button aria-labelledby="save-label"></button>

<button title="Close"></button>

<button><span>Delete</span></button>

<!-- Hidden from the accessibility tree; no label needed. -->
<button aria-hidden="true"></button>

<!-- Not a control this rule checks; `area` is covered by `useAltText`. -->
<area href="#" />

<!-- Not a control at all. -->
<div></div>

```
